/**
 * DualSense artwork, traced to filled regions.
 *
 * Every control is its own path, which is what makes it usable here: each one can be filled
 * independently as its input changes. The linework is not drawn -- it is the GAP between filled
 * regions, so the card background showing through is what reads as the outline. That means the
 * body fill must stay lighter than the card, or the drawing disappears.
 *
 * DOCUMENT ORDER IS LOAD-BEARING. The shell paths come after most controls and carry holes where
 * those controls sit; reordering them paints the shell over the buttons. Render this array in
 * order.
 *
 * The source file has no ids. The role for each path was established by rendering it and reading
 * its bounding box, so this mapping is the identification -- do not renumber it.
 *
 * Generated from "Dual Sense.svg"; regenerate rather than hand-edit.
 */

